* TX HBT sizing testbench (issue #21). SIZING EVIDENCE, not a spec result.
* Generated by sim/tx/make_tb.py; cells inlined from design/tx/netlists/.
* Not simulated here (MOS, blocked on #3): mux2to1_cml, ffe_en, lvl_cml2cmos.
* Pad/ESD is a lumped stand-in (4 ohm + 100 fF per leg), not the pad_esd cell.
* Circuit body only: klt sim supplies .lib / .control / .end.
* PDK rsil is an OSDI (r3_cmc) model, which the host ngspice cannot load (#3), so
* rsil is a behavioural stand-in using the PDK symbol's own value formula
* (R = 9e-6/w + 7.0*l/w ohm at b=0, /m) and the model's tc1; rscale carries the
* rsh corner (res_bcs 6.02, res_typ 7.0, res_wcs 7.98 ohm/sq).
.param rscale=0.86
.subckt rsil 1 2 bn
.param w=0.5e-6 l=0.5e-6 b=0 m=1
R1 1 2 r='(9.0e-6/w + 7.0*rscale*l/w)/m' tc1=3.1m
.ends rsil
.subckt bias vdd vss vbn
*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
*.iopin vbn
XRref vdd vbn vss rsil w=4u l=114.3u m=1 b=0
XQref vbn vbn er vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XRer er vss vss rsil w=4u l=36.57u m=1 b=0
XCvbn vbn vss cap_cmim w=7u l=7u m=1
.ends

.subckt predriver vdd vss inp inn vbn outp outn
*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
*.iopin inp
*.iopin inn
*.iopin vbn
*.iopin outp
*.iopin outn
XQ1 outn inp e vss npn13G2 Nx=4
XQ2 outp inn e vss npn13G2 Nx=4
XQt e vbn et vss npn13G2 Nx=4
XRe et vss vss rsil w=8u l=18.29u m=1 b=0
XRL1 vdd outp vss rsil w=8u l=68.57u m=1 b=0
XRL2 vdd outn vss rsil w=8u l=68.57u m=1 b=0
.ends

.subckt driver_ffe vdd vss inp inn pip pin vbn vbp0 vbp1 vbp2 outp outn
*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
*.iopin inp
*.iopin inn
*.iopin pip
*.iopin pin
*.iopin vbn
*.iopin vbp0
*.iopin vbp1
*.iopin vbp2
*.iopin outp
*.iopin outn
XQM1 outn inp em vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XQM2 outp inn em vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XQTM em vbn etm vss npn13G2 Nx=8
XREM etm vss vss rsil w=16u l=18.29u m=1 b=0
XRT1 vdd outp vss rsil w=16u l=114.3u m=1 b=0
XRT2 vdd outn vss rsil w=16u l=114.3u m=1 b=0
XQP0a outp pip ep0 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQP0b outn pin ep0 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQTP0 ep0 vbp0 etp0 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XREP0 etp0 vss vss rsil w=4u l=41.14u m=1 b=0
XQP1a outp pip ep1 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQP1b outn pin ep1 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQTP1 ep1 vbp1 etp1 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XREP1 etp1 vss vss rsil w=4u l=41.14u m=1 b=0
XQP2a outp pip ep2 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQP2b outn pin ep2 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XQTP2 ep2 vbp2 etp2 vss npn13G2 Nx=1
XREP2 etp2 vss vss rsil w=4u l=41.14u m=1 b=0
.ends

